## Architecture

```
CSV -> Spark -> bronze Parquet (Hive) -> silver sessions -> gold features/labels
     -> SQL analytics | stats | ML (sklearn, XGBoost, Spark MLlib, H2O) -> MLflow
     -> scores -> MongoDB -> FastAPI -> Streamlit
```

One command: `ecom all` · tests + lint in CI

